  "description": "Dr. Jin Ae-Gyeom returns to Gangchun, the rural village where he spent his childhood with his beloved older brother Pil-Ju, to open a clinic. Just as he arrives, Pil-Ju appears, as if he had been waiting for her. But the affectionate, endearing Pil-Ju from his memories is nowhere to be found; instead, the man standing before him has become a host at a host bar. Even so, Ae-Gyeom’s pure love, his dream of becoming a devoted husband, remains unchanged. He is prepared to do anything to ensure he never has to part with Pil-Ju. Even if that “anything” means…\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
